# Browser Test After Every Feature / Fix

After implementing any frontend feature, UI change, or bug fix, **always** run a browser walkthrough test before considering the task done.

## Local Services

| Service  | URL                         | How to start (if not running)                                      |
|----------|-----------------------------|--------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Backend  | http://localhost:8000       | `Start-Process .\.venv\Scripts\python.exe "-m uvicorn api.main:app --port 8000"` |
| Frontend | http://localhost:3000       | `npm run dev` inside `frontend/`                                   |

Check both ports with `netstat -ano | findstr ":8000 \|:3000 "` before starting.

