## What to Test

### 1. The feature you just built
- Navigate to the affected page.
- Take a screenshot to confirm it renders correctly.
- Interact with the core action (submit form, toggle, click button).
- Verify the result updates in the UI.

### 2. Regression check — all nav pages
| Page | URL |
|---|---|
| Dashboard | `/app` |
| Weight | `/app/weight` |
| Meals | `/app/meals` |
| Workouts | `/app/workouts` |
| Missions | `/app/missions` |
| AI Coach | `/app/coach` |
| Progress | `/app/progress` |

For each: load the page, confirm it does not show an error or blank screen.

### 3. Agent chat (if any backend/agent change)
Open the **Chat to log** drawer and send:
- `"What is my current weight trend?"` → expects `get_weight_trend` tool call
- `"Give me my daily coaching summary"` → expects `generate_daily_coaching` tool call

Confirm the `▶ N tools used` indicator appears in the chat bubble.

## Pass Criteria

- No page shows a blank screen or unhandled error.
- The feature under test works end-to-end with real data.
- Screenshots taken for every page that changed.

## Known Limitations

- Google Sheets free-tier quota: 60 reads/min. Space out rapid test runs by ~60 s to avoid 429 errors.
- `total_loss_kg` from `/progress/summary` is negative when the user has **gained** weight since first log — the UI must show `"Total gained"` with the absolute value in that case.
